CREATED:20260413T153714Z
DESCRIPTION:Duke Anesthesiology is proud to announce the 34th Annual Acade
 mic Evening - a distinguished event commemorating scientific excellence a
 nd scholarly activity within our department. As the pinnacle of our resea
 rch endeavors\, this celebration gathers junior-level investigators and f
 aculty to share the results of their research pursuits\, spanning diverse
  areas of study including basic and translational science\, clinical rese
 arch\, population health research\, case reports\, and quality improvemen
 t projects. Moreover\, Academic Evening serves as a catalyst for fosterin
 g new collaborations and partnerships among our esteemed colleagues. As w
 e reflect upon more than three decades of progress since our event's ince
 ption\, the steadfast goal of Academic Evening remains unchanged - to pro
 pel forward and showcase discovery in the field of anesthesiology\, criti
 cal care\, and pain management\, ultimately enhancing the care of our pat
 ients.
DURATION:PT3H30M
DTSTAMP:20260413T153714Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T053000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260413T153714Z
